hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16706","He said: Abd al-Samad narrated to us, he said: my father narrated to me, he said: Humayd ibn Qays narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Muadh al-Taymi, he said: and he was from the companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) addressed us and mentioned the hadith."
